\section{Introduction}

% 指令微调是释放大模型在预训练阶段习得的大量知识与强大的推理能力，以提升模型对于各类复杂任务的解决能力的基石。
% 因此，指令数据集的构建成为了提升模型性能，并确保模型泛化能力的关键环节。为此，目前已有诸如Self-Instruct、FLAN、Alpaca等一系列工作，通过人工标注或自动合成等方式获得一系列指令数据集。目前，这些数据集的总规模可能已达千万级别。然而，当前的大模型在复杂的指令遵循任务，以及相对罕见任务与领域的问题上的性能仍不能完全令人满意。这是因为，现有研究在构建面向通用领域的数据集时，并未直接考虑现有指令数据的分布，并有意识地拓展其分布的覆盖广度与指令的深度。

Instruction tuning serves as a cornerstone for unleashing the vast knowledge and reasoning capabilities of large pretrained models \citep{longpre2023flan,ouyang2022training}. Consequently, the construction of high-quality instruction datasets has become essential for improving model performance and generalization ability. Several efforts have constructed instruction datasets through manual annotation or automatic synthesis, with the total size of these datasets having reached tens of millions \citep{ahmad2025opencodeinstruct, nayak2024learning}. However, current large models still struggle with complex instruction-following tasks and show limitation in ``rare'' tasks with low frequency \citep{qin2025incentivizing}. 

% 指令数据集分布的“宽度”与“深度”——即任务类型与相关知识类别的覆盖广度与单一任务内指令的复杂度，是影响大模型能力边界的两个核心维度。宽度的扩展有助于提高模型对多样任务、多种领域的适应能力，而深度的增强则能够促进模型在复杂推理、组合泛化等方面的表现。
% 然而，如何设计有效的、\textbf{可控、可解释}的指令生成策略，使生成的数据能够在宽度与深度两个维度持续扩展，以持续引导模型学习更高阶的认知能力，是目前指令合成领域亟待解决的问题。但在这一方面，尚欠缺统一的方法论与实证研究。

A main reason would be that existing works overlooked the distribution of existing data, and thus failed to efficiently enhance the ``coverage and ``depth of synthesized instructions, and thus limit the model performance in solving rare tasks and difficult tasks \citep{wang2024survey,liu2024best,long2024llms}.
The ``coverage of an instruction dataset refers to the coverage of task types and knowledge categories it covers, while the `depth reflects the complexity of instructions within individual tasks. Both two dimensions are essential to enlarge the capability boundaries of large models \citep{shengyu2023instruction}.
Expanding the coverage improves the model’s ability to generalize across domains, while increasing depth helps enhance complex reasoning ability and compositional generalizability \citep{sinha2024survey,zhong2025survey}. However, a key challenge remains: how to design \textbf{effective, controllable and interpretable} instruction generation strategies that continuously expand the instruction space along both dimensions, guiding models to acquire higher-level capabilities \citep{zhang2023survey,qian2022controllable,qin2022cold}. Currently, there is a lack of unified methodology and empirical research in this area.

% 针对这一问题，本研究提出一种指令数据构建框架，旨在度量现有指令数据的覆盖宽度与指令深度的基础上，合成低覆盖区域、高复杂度的指令，以持续扩大指令数据集的覆盖宽度与深度。具体而言，这一框架包含四个部分：(1) 分层、多语言标签系统，以了解指令数据集的内容分布，(2) 高信息量种子数据筛选，这一部分依托标签系统，从候选指令池中，选择出高信息量，例如覆盖度低、难度高的指令; (3) 基于进化算法的指令数据集合成，在种子数据基础上，向复杂度等方向进化，合成一系列新数据，以确保模型对于种子数据的分布内泛化性。同时合成数据又可作为加入候选指令池，供挑选种子数据；(4) 模型缺陷诊断系统与针对性数据合成系统，以发现现有模型的知识与能力缺陷，并针对缺陷合成数据以进行修补。以这种方式，我们得以有针对性地发现并填补现有指令数据池的空白与缺陷。如图\ref{fig:frame}所示，这四个系统形成一个闭环循环关系，以持续扩展指令数据集的覆盖度与深度。

To address this challenge, we propose a comprehensive instruction data construction framework, which goal is to measure the current data distribution and synthesize instructions that target under-covered and high-complexity regions, thereby expanding both the coverage and depth of the dataset. This framework consists of four core components:
(1) a hierarchical and multilingual tagging system to understand the content and ability distribution of existing instruction content;
(2) informative seed data selection to identify valuable instructions with low coverage or high difficulty;
(3) evolutionary data synthesis to synthesize more complex instructions by evolving from seed data;
(4) a model deficiency diagnosis based targeted synthesis module to identify potential flaws in the model’s knowledge or capabilities and synthesize data to address those weaknesses.
As illustrated in Figure~\ref{fig:frame}, these four modules form a closed-loop system that can iteratively expand the coverage and depth of the instruction dataset.



