\section{Construction of InfinityInstruct-Subject}

% 图~\ref{fig:frame}展示了InfinityInstruction-Sub的构建过程。这一过程开始于搜集大量高质量的种子指令数据。我们系统性搜集了截止2024.3所有基于手动构建和基于GPT-4/ChatGPT自动构建的通用域的指令数据集，构成了一个规模$\sim$7 Millon的数据池。具体数据集列表如表\ref{tab:dataset_summary}所示。随后，我们构建了一个基于大模型的自动标签系统以了解数据池分布；从覆盖度和深度两个维度出发，选择出了一系列高信息量种子数据；随后从种子数据出发，利用进化算法，向复杂度与难度方向进化，合成了逾百万条指令数据；在已有种子数据与合成数据基础上，我们构建了一个模型缺陷诊断系统，并针对模型的现有缺陷有针对性地合成数据，以迅速修补模型缺陷；最后，我们构建了基于语义相似度的严格的防泄漏框架，以防范到潜在的数据泄露风险。

The construction process of InfinityInstruct-Subject (InfInstruct-Sub) is illustrated in Figure~\ref{fig:frame}. The process starts by collecting high-quality seed instructions. We systematically gathered all general-domain instruction datasets both manually created and automatically generated using GPT-4\citep{achiam2023gpt} or ChatGPT available up to March 2024, resulting in a data pool of approximately 7 million samples. The included datasets are listed in Table~\ref{tab:dataset_summary} of the Appendix. 
Next, we developed an automatic labeling system based on large language models (LLMs) to analyze the distribution of the data pool. From the perspectives of coverage and depth, we selected a set of high-information seed instructions. 
Then, we applied an evolutionary algorithm to generate over one million new instruction samples by evolving towards greater complexity and difficulty.
Building on both the seed and synthesized data, we constructed a model deficiency diagnosis system. This system identifies gaps in model capabilities and guides the targeted synthesis of new data to efficiently address those weaknesses.
Finally, we implemented a strict semantic similarity–based data leakage prevention framework to detect and mitigate potential risks of data leakage throughout the construction process.



