% 虽然我们尽量广泛地搜集了指令数据，仍然存在大量潜在的被遗漏的话题。此外，模型也可能未能完全捕获指令数据集内包含的信息。
% 这导致模型可能依旧存在一系列知识或能力缺陷。一种弥补方法是持续扩增种子数据集的规模和进化算法数据合成的规模。然而，这种方法不可避免面将合成大量重复数据，导致数据冗余，并且效率较低。针对这一问题，我们探索精准诊断模型的缺陷，并针对缺陷合成数据。如图\ref{fig:deficiency_diagnosis}所示，具体而言，我们首先构建了一个与种子数据集同分布的诊断数据集$\mathcal{D}=\{\mathcal{D}_i\}_{i=1}^N$，其中，$\mathcal{D}_i=\{x_i, y_i\}$为query和对应的response，随后，使用经合成数据集微调后的模型$M_{\text{FT}}$，针对$x_i$上生成回复$\hat{y}_i$。下一步，我们利用一个Oracle model对比$y_i$与$\hat{y}_i$，并诊断$\hat{y}_i$中存在的问题。后续，给定问题，利用Oracle model，有针对性地合成新的指令。驱动Oracle model所用Prompt如图所示。 

% ##### 感觉缺少了很多细节，Oracle model具体是什么，并诊断$\hat{y}_i$中存在的问题怎么做的

Despite comprehensive data collection efforts, many topics remain underrepresented, and the model may still fail to capture key knowledge and skills within instruction set, leading to capability and knowledge deficiency.
While expanding the seed set or synthesizing more data via evolutionary methods can help, these approaches often produce redundant and inefficient results.
To address this issue, we adopt a more targeted strategy: diagnosing model deficiencies and synthesizing instructions specifically to fill those gaps.

As illustrated in Figure~\ref{fig:deficiency_diagnosis}, we first construct a diagnosis dataset $\mathcal{D} = {\mathcal{D}_i}{i=1}^N$ drawn from the same distribution as the seed dataset, where each $\mathcal{D}i = {x_i, y_i}$ represents an input query and its corresponding reference response. We then use the fine-tuned model $M{\text{FT}}$ to generate a response $\hat{y}_i$ for each $x_i$.
Next, we compare $\hat{y}_i$ with $y_i$ using an State-of-the-Art advanced large Oracle model, identifying knowledge or deficiencies in $\hat{y}_i$ with the prompt shown in Figure~\ref{fig:deficiency_prompt}. Given the diagnosed issues, we then prompt the Oracle model to generate new instructions that specifically address these deficiencies using the prompt in Figure~\ref{fig:deficiency_based_syn_prompt}, to target generate instructions that remedy deficiencies within the model.

