\caption{Same as Fig.~\ref{fig:XeF4}, but for Mg-porphyrin (a) and the Mg-porphyrin-derivatives Mg-bacteriochlorin (b) and Mg;23H-porphyrin-22,24-diid-5-imine (c).}
\label{fig:all}
