We compare the evolution of ADC and the effective conductivity of the corresponding shell lattices  at various thicknesses, throughout the optimization of $\ka_A^{\mathrm{Avg}}$.
The results (Figure~\ref{fig:effect-evolve-heat}) indicate that both quantities exhibit consistent trends over the course of the optimization.
