The rest of the paper is organized as follows. Section \ref{sec:literature} reviews the literature, and Section \ref{sec:setup} provides the setup. Section \ref{sec:dte} introduces distributional treatment effect parameters, their identification, and estimation. Section \ref{sec:asymptotics} presents asymptotic results. Section \ref{sec:experiments} discusses findings from simulated and real data. Section \ref{sec:conclusion} concludes. Appendix contains notations, proofs, and additional experimental results.


